## Interface: 16001
## Title: Fletcher
## Notes: Refills your quiver or ammo pouch with the best ammo the vendor sells, and marks it in the vendor window. Right click the vendor button or /ammo for the settings.
## Author: Florenzi
## Version: @project-version@
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Ammo_Arrow_02
## SavedVariables: FletcherDB

# Fletcher targets World of Warcraft: Forever only, whose toc is 16001.
# Check the live value in game with
#   /run print((select(4, GetBuildInfo())))
# before changing the line above, and change FOREVER_INTERFACE in
# Fletcher.lua with it.
#
# The settings are account-wide on purpose: the Forever client writes a
# per-character SavedVariables file but never loads it back.
#
# There is no X-Curse-Project-ID yet; it is added once the CurseForge
# project exists, and the release workflow then publishes there too.

Fletcher.lua
Fletcher_Vendor.lua
Fletcher_Options.lua
